Package: slimeta
Title: Stacked Linear Mixed-Effects Framework for Multivariate
        Meta-Analysis
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Nusrat", "Rabbee", email = "rabbee@berkeley.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the Stacked Linear Mixed-Effects (SLIM) framework for
    multivariate meta-analysis with correlated endpoints, as described in
    Rabbee (2026) <doi:10.1186/s12874-026-02852-x>. SLIM enables joint
    modeling of multiple endpoints across studies, estimation of between-study
    correlation structure, translation of treatment effects between endpoints
    via the eta coefficient, hypothesis testing for effect heterogeneity across
    strata (Cochran's Q and Dunnett tests), and sample size calculations for
    trial design. Built on top of the 'metafor' package.
